      "content": "the purple tint you mentioned sounds weird. i dont see much purple yet, mostly just that stunted growth in the shady spots. do you think it's worth getting a soil test or should i just try a balanced fertilizer first to see if it helps? also any tips for applying it in this wet portland weather?",
